---
metadata: {
    partial_name: "Dashboard | Content",
}
---
{%- comment -%}
  The dashboard: a welcome and the documentation cards. Called with:
    render 'dashboard/dashboard_content', documentations: documentations, first_name: first_name
  documentations: the enabled documentation records, from dashboard/get_documentations.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- function default_images = 'dashboard/default_images' -%}
    <div class="grid-container">
        <div class="spacer section"></div>
        
        <div class="banner-message-container">
            <h2>Hi {{ first_name }}, welcome to the Insites seedling application!</h2>
            <div class="spacer"></div>
            <p>Thanks for joining us! We're thrilled to welcome you to the Insites seedling application. Your dashboard is all set to assist you in exploring our powerful platform, packed with tools to simplify your business operations. Dive into the dashboard to find detailed documentation and guidelines that will get you up and running in no time, allowing you to make the most out of Insites.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="spacer xxxx-large"></div>

        <div class="grid-x grid-padding-x grid-padding-y dashboard-main-container">
            {% for document in documentations %}
                {%- liquid
                  comment
                    Values written into attributes are escaped here and written with print: an
                    output tag on this platform turns an escaped double quote back into a quote.
                  endcomment
                  assign fallback_image = default_images[document.properties.title]
                  assign link_attr = document.properties.link | escape
                  assign image_attr = document.image.url | default: fallback_image | replace: ' ', '%20' | escape
                  assign title_attr = document.properties.title | escape
                -%}
                <div class="large-3 medium-6 small-12 cell">
                    <div class="dashboard-card-list-container" data-link="{% print link_attr %}">
                        <img src="{% print image_attr %}" alt="{% print title_attr %}">
                        <div class="dashboard-card-desc">
                            <h4>{{ document.properties.title }}</h4>
                            <p>{{ document.properties.description  }}</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="dashboard-card-link">
                            <a>{{ document.properties.link_label  }}</a>
                            <i class="icon-arrow-forward"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
        <div class="spacer section"></div>
    </div>

<script>
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function() {
        document.querySelectorAll('.dashboard-card-list-container').forEach(card => {
            card.addEventListener('click', function() {
                const link = card.getAttribute('data-link');
                if (link) {
                    window.open(link, '_blank');
                }
            });
        });
    });
</script>